@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor #087C61
skinparam ClassBorderColor #087C61
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #EAF7ED
skinparam ActorBorderColor #192D3D
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor #EAF7ED
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor #087C61
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #EAF7ED
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #087C61
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF7ED
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #087C61
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF6DF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #C5AB62
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam dpi 160
actor "Administrator" as Admin
actor "Account owner" as User
participant "UserRegisterView /\nUserPasswordResetView" as AdminView
participant "ForcePasswordChangeMiddleware" as Gate
participant "PasswordChangeFlowView" as Change
database "CustomUser /\nAccountEvent" as DB
== Administrator issues a password ==
Admin -> AdminView : create account, or POST Reset password
AdminView -> DB : set password; must_change_password = true
AdminView -> DB : reset only: record event (no password)
AdminView --> Admin : reset only: temporary password shown once\n(no-store page, not kept in messages)
note right of AdminView
 Not allowed: own account,
 or a superuser unless you are one.
 A reset also signs the owner out everywhere.
end note
== First sign-in ==
User -> Gate : any page after signing in
alt must_change_password
 Gate --> User : redirect to Change password\n(API requests receive HTTP 403)
 note right of Gate : only the change pages, sign-out\nand static files are allowed
else already their own password
 Gate --> User : the requested page
end
== Choosing their own password ==
User -> Change : POST old, new, confirm
Change -> Change : standard password rules;\nnew must differ from the old one
alt rejected
 Change --> User : errors; flag unchanged
else accepted
 Change -> DB : save password; must_change_password = false
 Change -> DB : record event password changed (no password)
 Change --> User : confirmation; the whole system opens
end
@enduml
